stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NEW
    NEW --> PAID : pay [async] [if retryBudgetLeft]
    NEW --> PAYMENT_DECLINED : [failure of pay]
    NEW --> CANCELLED : cancel
    PAID --> SHIPPED : ship [if allItemsPacked] [watches Item: allIn PACKED]
    PAYMENT_DECLINED --> NEW : [if retryBudgetLeft]
    PAYMENT_DECLINED --> CANCELLED : cancel
    SHIPPED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    note right of PAID : watches Item
